   1:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** /*
   2:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — settings_page.c
   3:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * Settings menu overlay (port of Source/ui/settings_page.lua).
   4:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * Staged-changes semantics preserved exactly: open() snapshots storage into
   5:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * the staged copy; left/right adjust ONLY the staged copy; A saves (applies
   6:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * staged → storage, fires onChange) unless the row is the Clear Cookies
   7:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * action (executes immediately); B discards. Animation: 300ms ease-out cubic
   8:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * box scale from center, contents clipped, drawn only past t>0.4.
   9:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  */
