  41:Source/ui/settings_page.c **** /* ── Scrolling list geometry ─────────────────────�
  42:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * The panel is fixed-size; the row list scrolls under it as the browser
  43:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * grows more settings. Rows live between the title (24px) and the footer
  44:Source/ui/settings_page.c ****  * (18px); SETTINGS_ROW_PITCH is the per-row stride. */
